# Pairs with DenialsAudited. RecordDeniedAsync swallows a failed write without
# the write-failure counter, so a refusal the caller saw leaves no trace.
MODULE: AuditDenialWriteFailureUncounted
TARGET: DenialsAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed denial write is neither recorded nor counted
PERTURBS: Authorize

--- FIND
!.pc = "refused", !.meter = ~w]]
--- REPLACE
!.pc = "refused", !.meter = FALSE]]
--- END
